{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1190946-in-the-corebook-there-a-rumor-that-winter-wolf-rides-wolfblooded-during-storms","id":1190946,"title":"In the corebook there a rumor that winter wolf rides wolfblooded during storms?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-02T04:53:57-08:00","id":1190946,"title":"In the corebook there a rumor that winter wolf rides wolfblooded during storms?","content":"I fine that interesting can any one expand on that and telll me your game/headcannon thing. I know it\u2019s kind of \u2018special snowflake\u2019 but I\u2019m thinking about a stormlords wolfblooded vampire that sometimes gets posessed by winter wolf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-02T07:57:27-08:00","id":1190979,"title":"","content":"Presumably they would do it to send a message to werewolves in the same pack as the wolf-blooded. I think it's more a matter of them taking an opportunity to possess something that already has a link to them, and not them just possessing the same person over and over. Winter Wolf's appearances are supposed to be rare.<br /> <br /> Yes, playing said character would be pretty 'special snowflake' but most characters are to begin with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 03-02-2018, 11:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-02T12:06:14-08:00","id":1191067,"title":"","content":"Thanks! I do think it would be kewl,to have winter wolf claim the vampire wolfblood will abolustly destroying some strix","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T02:41:33-08:00","id":1191292,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't worry too much about the &quot;special snowflake&quot; factor. The important thing is that you match the tone and power level of your game. As long as the snowflakeness is just part of the character and not an all-consuming black hole that steals all attention and/or trivializes every encounter it doesn't really matter if you're half vampire, half werewolf, half robot and 250% cop.<br /> <br /> And honestly? A vampire that sometimes loses control to an inhuman predator and kills the shit out of things is just, y'know, a vampire. Having their Frenzy tinged with weird spiritual side effects because of their wolf blood is entry-level crossover stuff that should be permissible in any chronicle that features werewolf-vampire interaction, or just vampires with mystical leanings. Having it be Winter Wolf specifically might be pushing it a bit in terms of power level and setting-wide ramifications, but it would work fine if your campaign is more on the apocalyptic side of things.<br /> <br /> It's also a good source of conflict. After all, the spirit <i>says</i> it's Winter Wolf, but what proof is there? And even if it is, is being the flesh-puppet of an ancient, amoral spirit-god really all that desirable? What does he want with you, anyway? Come to think of it, it can't have taken him all night to deal with the striges, but you only came to at the next sunset. What was he doing with your body all that time?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13628-terrorforge","name":"Terrorforge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13628_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"185"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T19:49:09-07:00","id":1222150,"title":"","content":"I wonder what your pack would think of you","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-26T09:53:46-07:00","id":1222278,"title":"","content":"Wasn't there also a line about the Firstborn not being able to manifest in the twilight without instantly draining the area from all essence?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Dam da namsithim.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12696-lost-his-mind","name":"Lost-His-Mind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12696_2.jpeg","title":"Membe